// Typed browser witness for `wasm.browser`.
// `#Target(JS)` keeps the observable side on the supplied browser/JS output
// sink (`wasm.browser.io_write`), with `wasm.browser.report` for panic and
// `wasm.browser.startup` for entry. The machine also supplies its typed
// `wasm.browser.allocator` rather than deriving providers from the triple.
#WasmExport
fn double(n: Int) Int -> n * 2

#Target(JS)
fn run() { print(double(21)) }
